<title>UK: Clarke, cabinet review UK economic, budget outlook.</title>
<headline>Clarke, cabinet review UK economic, budget outlook.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chancellor of the Exchequer Kenneth Clarke is outlining Britain's economic prospects to Thursday's meeting of the cabinet as part of preparations for next month's budget, officials said.</p>
<p>They said the meeting would also be an opportunity for ministers to make their budget priorities known to Clarke.</p>
<p>The meeting began at 0930 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom 44-171-542 7767</p>
